    "directions": [
      "Preheat oven to 180 degrees for 10 mins",
      "In a large bowl, add bananas with the help of a fork or spoon and mash it properly.",
      "Add eggs and whisk it well. Add milk, vanilla essence, melted butter and mix it well.",
      "Add refined flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, caster sugar, and lightly fold the wet ingredients into dry ingredients until combined well.",
      "Add dark chocolate and combine the batter thick and chunky. Do not over mix the batter.",
      "Pour it in a muffin mould and Bake for about 15 â 20 minutes at 180 .",
      "Place on a wire rack to cool for 5 minutes before removing muffins from the tin.",
      "Dust icing sugar on top of it."
